### ==========================================
### 工作空间管理 — Workspace Management
### 路径前缀：/workspace
### 工作空间为树形结构，支持多级子空间
### ==========================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:9000

### ------------------- 工作空间树形列表 -------------------
### @name Get Workspace Tree List
# 返回树形结构的工作空间列表，按 parentId 层级组织
GET {{baseUrl}}/workspace/list?name= HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ------------------- 创建工作空间 -------------------
### @name Create Workspace
# parentId=0 或 null 表示根节点
POST {{baseUrl}}/workspace/create HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "parentId": 0,
  "name": "研发中心",
  "order": 1,
  "leader": "王五",
  "phone": "13600136000",
  "email": "wangwu@company.com",
  "remark": "公司研发中心"
}

### ------------------- 更新工作空间 -------------------
### @name Update Workspace
POST {{baseUrl}}/workspace/update?id=1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "研发中心（已更名）",
  "leader": "赵六",
  "order": 1
}

### ------------------- 删除工作空间 -------------------
### @name Delete Workspace
# 存在子工作空间时禁止删除，需先删除所有子空间
POST {{baseUrl}}/workspace/delete?id=2 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
